<title>AUSTRIA: VA Stahl, Kloeckner to cooperate.</title>
<headline>VA Stahl, Kloeckner to cooperate.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian steel maker VA Stahl said on Friday its VA Stahl Linz subsidiary was aiming at closer cooperation with Germany's Kloeckner Stahl- und Metallhandel, a unit of Viag group's Kloeckner &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Kloeckner planned to take over a majority stake in VA Stahl's trading unit, Voest Alpine Stahlhandel, while VA Stahl would acquire Kloeckner's holding in Switzerland's Steel Service Center Dr. Ing. Koenig, VA Stahl said in a statement.</p>
<p>The move would enable Kloeckner to concentrate more on its core steel distribution activities, while VA Stahl would concentrate on processing activities, it said.</p>
<p>The agreement was subject to approval by cartel authorities, VA Stahl added.</p>
